- All components go in src/components. UI primitives in ui/, shared layout in common/, feature-specific in features/<feature-name>/
- All TanStack Query hooks go in src/queries/<feature>/
- All route strings must use ROUTES constant from src/constants/routes.ts
- All API endpoint strings must use ENDPOINTS from src/lib/api/endpoints.ts
- Use cn() from src/lib/utils.ts for all className merging
- TypeScript strict mode is on — no `any`
- Prefer named exports over default exports for components
- Every new feature folder must have an index.ts barrel file